ful bride, I vote for you over her!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":22895,"PostDate":1170381884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                well since she looks constipated and you look like a beautiful bride, I vote for you over her!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165971180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c88d2495ec9442a44619d5962306d06b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;jilly76&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;You look way better in the dress!! So I take it you made your decision?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; Yep I did make my decision!&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; !!!! \n \n I&#039;m so relieved now I can move on to fun things like invitations and DIY projects. hehe I love that stuff. The best part was we (MOH &amp;amp; I) went to the store last night and found the bridesmaid dresses as well. So exciting. We&#039;re planning on getting the AfterSix 6263. So exciting!! \n \n It feels like a huge rock got lifted from my shoulders.","Attachments":[],"Id":22900,"PostDate":1170382340,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>jilly76<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">You look way better in the dress!! So I take it you made your decision?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div> Yep I did make my decision!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> !!!! <br \/> <br \/> I'm so relieved now I can move on to fun things like invitations and DIY projects. hehe I love that stuff. The best part was we (MOH & I) went to the store last night and found the bridesmaid dresses as well. So exciting. We're planning on getting the AfterSix 6263. So exciting!! <br \/> <br \/> It feels like a huge rock got lifted from my shoulders.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.ayotte@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.27.238.196","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1169948520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207103.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Melissa~","Id":207103,"Name":"~Melissa~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af8a5fdbc27da76794dc3fef605835d3","RawContent":"I am so glad you decided, I really love that one on you-it is such a good feeling to get things like that taken care of. Now comes the really fun part, making the rest of the celebration personal.","Attachments":[],"Id":22902,"PostDate":1170382460,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am so glad you decided, I really love that one on you-it is such a good feeling to get things like that taken care of. Now comes 