ally would love some feedback on mine.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Date: April 21, 2017&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;April 21, 2016 - Electronic STD linking to our website with location, date, time details&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Aug 21, 2016 - Physical invites&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jan 14, 2017 - After holiday e-reminder (\"It&#039;s cold, join us in Jamaica\")&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jan 21, 2017 - RSVP due&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;April 21, 2017 - The BIG Day&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thoughts or input? &amp;nbsp;I have my RSVP due 3 months before so I know how many things I need to purchase for favours, bags etc. My OOT bags will be given out prior to travel, due to logistical issues, so I need to know before hand.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912883,"PostDate":1460723612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I know there have been several posts on invitation timeline but I reeeeally would love some feedback on mine.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Date: April 21, 2017<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>April 21, 2016 - Electronic STD linking to our website with location, date, time details<\/p>\n<p>Aug 21, 2016 - Physical invites<\/p>\n<p>Jan 14, 2017 - After holiday e-reminder (\"It's cold, join us in Jamaica\")<\/p>\n<p>Jan 21, 2017 - RSVP due<\/p>\n<p>April 21, 2017 - The BIG Day<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thoughts or input? \u00a0I have my RSVP due 3 months before so I know how many things I need to purchase for favours, bags etc. My OOT bags will be given out prior to travel, due to logistical issues, so I need to know before hand.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxinegrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395269678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxRoy2015","Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.97.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80042,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ccece4bb7db6c64825dd49a544f4b8c8","RawContent":"We are twins on our dates! You are more on top of things than me. I&#039;m sending STD monday. Maybe invites August sounds good. I would love to hear more opinions!\n\n\nSent from my SAMSUNG-SM-G900A using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1912886,"PostDate":1460728907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are twins on our dates! You are more on top of things than me. I'm sending STD monday. Maybe invites August sounds good. I would love to hear more opinions!<br><br>\nSent from my SAMSUNG-SM-G900A using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Emai