{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.59.207.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82adb018bb1f38fe38a70b7ea59625e9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Sandygray88\" post=\"1870458\" timestamp=\"1409786864\"]\nSome of the pics without the chair sashes look great so I&#039;m starting to think no chair sashes also. I probably am going to splurge on some flowers though...was going to do a dyi for the bridesmaids bouquets but the fresh tropical flower ones look so great. Is anyone else getting the divine package? Are you adding a photographer ?[\/quote]\nI am getting the divine package as well, and I am bringing my own photographer as a guest.  I&#039;m up in the air about centerpieces still, I am thinking we are only going to have 20-25 people so paying the resort for centerpieces for 2-3 tables does not seem like that as big of an issue, I may still DIY though, I am just worried about glass breaking in transit!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1870561,"PostDate":1409845176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Sandygray88, on 03 September 2014 - 07:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Some of the pics without the chair sashes look great so I'm starting to think no chair sashes also. I probably am going to splurge on some flowers though...was going to do a dyi for the bridesmaids bouquets but the fresh tropical flower ones look so great. Is anyone else getting the divine package? Are you adding a photographer ?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI am getting the divine package as well, and I am bringing my own photographer as a guest.  I'm up in the air about centerpieces still, I am thinking we are only going to have 20-25 people so paying the resort for centerpieces for 2-3 tables does not seem like that as big of an issue, I may still DIY though, I am just worried about glass breaking in transit!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1442449277","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.34.194.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"682398d55f0dbe9ab40bb50c11d2bb6a","RawContent":"I read some suggestions to get some nice vases( maybe plastic) fill with sand\/ shells...and have the bridesmaids put their bouquets in for the reception as table decorations.","Attachments":[],"Id":1870928,"PostDate":1410112635,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I read some suggestions to get some nice vases( maybe plastic) fill with sand\/ shells...and have the bridesmaids put their bouquets in for the reception as table decorations. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandygray8.sg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407693970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Sandygray88","Id":279388,"Name":"Sandygray88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e41216b8c817e4ee52fe37776a815c77","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KAT2015\" post=\"1870181\" timestamp=\"1409669998\"]\nCoral seems to be a hot colour! We&#039;re doing coral, teal and mint with gold accent (I believe!).\n\nThe more I look online, the more I simplify my decor.  I&#039;m thinking 2-3 pillar candles in the middle, surrounded by some sort of wood wreath (or dark brown twine) with fake flowers in our colours.  Then maybe little shells on the table and candle favours for each guest (lit so they are part of the decor).\n\nI&#039;m thinking now I won&#039;t do any chair sashes at all.\n\nYour wedding plans sound dreamy!!! I would have loved the fountain but didn&#039;t want to tie ourselves into the $1500 charge for the extra decor - without the plank I&#039;m not sure how it would go and I wasn&#039;t risking it.  Castaways would have been amazing, but the $3000 isn&#039;t in our budget for it![\/quote]Hi @[member=\"KAT2015\"]!\n\nI also cannot justify paying $1500 to walk across the platform.  I saw a few youtube videos with brides walking beside the fountain so that is what I am going to do!!  Castaways is expensive but we have a friend that is coming that will do our photography so we will save there!  I am not a very crafty person so I am still thinking about decorations- yours sound beautiful though!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1871198,"PostDate":1410299302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KAT2015, on 02 September 2014 - 10:59 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Coral seems to be a hot colour! We're doing coral, teal and mint with gold accent (I believe!).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The more I look online, the more I simplify my decor. \u00a0I'm thinking 2-3 pillar candles in the middle, surrounded by some sort of wood wreath (or dark brown twine) with fake flowers in our colours. \u00a0Then maybe little shells on the table and candle favours for each guest (lit so they are part of the decor).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm thinking now I won't do any chair sashes at all.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your wedding plans sound dreamy!!! I would have loved the fountain but didn't want to tie ourselves into the $1500 charge for the extra decor - without the plank I'm not sure how it would go and I wasn't risking it. \u00a0Castaways would have been amazing, but the $3000 isn't in our budget for it!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279198\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279198-kat2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KAT2015<\/span><\/a>!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also cannot justify paying $1500 to walk across the platform.\u00a0 I saw a few youtube videos with brides walking beside the fountain so that is what I am going to do!!\u00a0 Castaways is expensive but we have a friend that is coming that will do our photography so we will save there!\u00a0 I am not a very crafty person so I am still thinking about decorations- yours sound beautiful though!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388150678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.59.207.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52ffd9eded52ec78b269c52d53757dcd","RawContent":"Hey all,\n\n  I don&#039;t know if anyone else is still figuring out centerpieces but I emailed my wedding coordinator pictures of floating candle bowls like this &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.save-on-crafts.com\/lilybowl.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.save-on-crafts.com\/lilybowl.html&lt;\/a&gt; and she said they had them for 20 dollars each.  So I am just going to do that and bring my own candles\/sea glass beads etc.  That way I don&#039;t have to transport glass, but I am not paying an arm and a leg for centerpieces!","Attachments":[],"Id":1871499,"PostDate":1410440120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey all,<br>\n  I don't know if anyone else is still figuring out centerpieces but I emailed my wedding coordinator pictures of floating candle bowls like this <a href='http:\/\/www.save-on-crafts.com\/lilybowl.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.save-on-c...m\/lilybowl.html<\/a> and she said they had them for 20 dollars each.  So I am just going to do that and bring my own candles\/sea glass beads etc.  That way I don't have to transport glass, but I am not paying an arm and a leg for centerpieces! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1442449277","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.46.224.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0211a254de927183ea04f54924177c19","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at Now Larimar in May 2015. I find that my costs are adding up!! Anyone planning there wedding now? or have had there wedding there recently?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know if for the cocktail hour after the ceremony if there is any music included? or suggest how long is resonable between ceremony and reception?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878022,"PostDate":1415507208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married at Now Larimar in May 2015. I find that my costs are adding up!! Anyone planning there wedding now? or have had there wedding there recently?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone know if for the cocktail hour after the ceremony if there is any music included? or suggest how long is resonable between ceremony and reception?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"astawarz@live.ca","IpAddress":"142.46.224.163","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415506605,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"astawarz","Id":281052,"Name":"astawarz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d7c71bd855cfb0fa78bea562232affe","RawContent":"@[member=\"astawarz\"]\n\n\nHello! My wedding is also May, well May 1 to be exact and I as well soon found my cost to be far exceeding our initial budget.\n\n\nThere Is no music included for the cocktail hour. You can add an iPod, band,DJ, etc for an additional cost of course. We added a band for $300.\n\n\nHope this helps :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1878221,"PostDate":1415752560,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281052\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281052-astawarz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">astawarz<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nHello! My wedding is also May, well May 1 to be exact and I as well soon found my cost to be far exceeding our initial budget.<br><br>\nThere Is no music included for the cocktail hour. You can add an iPod, band,DJ, etc for an additional cost of course. We added a band for $300.<br><br>\nHope this helps <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.128.4.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3a38bfd0a7900b000ceb704bf44edc6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Cwright\" post=\"1870050\" timestamp=\"1409607176\"]\n@[member=\"JYINGLI1\"]\n\nI am getting married on May 21st of 2015, and I am very interested in sharing decorations![\/quote]\n@[member=\"Cwright\"]\n\nI apologize for the delayed response, but I have not been on here lately. My wedding day is May 7th and I&#039;m doing my own centerpieces and aisle decor. I&#039;m going to pack as much as possible. My colors are shades of purple. I&#039;m going for a more elegant but simple looks. My bridesmaids are wearing eggplant purple dresses, but I&#039;m decorating with different shades of purple. I&#039;ve purchased lavender, purple, and cream flowers with accents of green. They are silk flower which look pretty realistic. I also purchased lavender and silver sequin table runners and different votives and submersible lights that I may add some accents to. I&#039;m trying to find mercury glass vases for the flowers (but might opt to DIY with plastic containers so they travel better). If you are serious about sharing any of the decor, I would be happy to make arrangements and leave when I can there. Just let me know!!\n\nThanks,\nJamie","Attachments":[],"Id":1878235,"PostDate":1415785821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Cwright, on 01 September 2014 - 05:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279519-jyingli1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JYINGLI1<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married on May 21st of 2015, and I am very interested in sharing decorations!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275744\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cwright<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I apologize for the delayed response, but I have not been on here lately. My wedding day is May 7th and I'm doing my own centerpieces and aisle decor. I'm going to pack as much as possible. My colors are shades of purple. I'm going for a more elegant but simple looks. My bridesmaids are wearing eggplant purple dresses, but I'm decorating with different shades of purple. I've purchased lavender, purple, and cream flowers with accents of green. They are silk flower which look pretty realistic. I also purchased lavender and silver sequin table runners and different votives and submersible lights that I may add some accents to. I'm trying to find mercury glass vases for the flowers (but might opt to DIY with plastic containers so they travel better). If you are serious about sharing any of the decor, I would be happy to make arrangements and leave when I can there. Just let me know!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks,<br>\nJamie<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jyingling814@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.128.4.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408633990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JYINGLI1","Id":279519,"Name":"JYINGLI1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.43.251.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa6beebed4ccd78b32529062a0bfc394","RawContent":"@[member=\"Cwright\"] Can you please post links to the YouTube videos with brides walking down the side of the fountain? I&#039;ve been trying to picture it. $1500 for the wooden plank is crazy!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878745,"PostDate":1416432618,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275744\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cwright<\/span><\/a> Can you please post links to the YouTube videos with brides walking down the side of the fountain? I've been trying to picture it. $1500 for the wooden plank is crazy!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccalightsey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.190.197.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405539863,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279045.jpg?_r=1434956018","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"RebeLight","Id":279045,"Name":"RebeLight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1416773540,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1459cfd5b20f77820eeee5c45050efce","RawContent":"@[member=\"RebeLight\"] Hope this helps! I think it looks really nice!\n\n[url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=QdN0hnksaQs\"]https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=QdN0hnksaQs[\/url]\n[quote name=\"JYINGLI1\" post=\"1878235\" timestamp=\"1415800221\"]\n@[member=\"Cwright\"]\n\nI apologize for the delayed response, but I have not been on here lately. My wedding day is May 7th and I&#039;m doing my own centerpieces and aisle decor. I&#039;m going to pack as much as possible. My colors are shades of purple. I&#039;m going for a more elegant but simple looks. My bridesmaids are wearing eggplant purple dresses, but I&#039;m decorating with different shades of purple. I&#039;ve purchased lavender, purple, and cream flowers with accents of green. They are silk flower which look pretty realistic. I also purchased lavender and silver sequin table runners and different votives and submersible lights that I may add some accents to. I&#039;m trying to find mercury glass vases for the flowers (but might opt to DIY with plastic containers so they travel better). If you are serious about sharing any of the decor, I would be happy to make arrangements and leave when I can there. Just let me know!!\n\nThanks,\nJamie[\/quote]\nHi Jamie,\n\nSorry I have not been on here in a while either!  I think I am going to stick with corals and oranges.  My mother in law wants to help with the decorations.  I did think of doing purples and teals for a little bit. Purple does sound beautiful!! Do you have any pictures you could send me of what you are thinking? Thanks so much!\n\nChristine","Attachments":[],"Id":1879002,"PostDate":1416773392,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279045\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279045-rebelight\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RebeLight<\/span><\/a> Hope this helps! I think it looks really nice!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/QdN0hnksaQs?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n<br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JYINGLI1, on 12 November 2014 - 09:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275744\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cwright<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I apologize for the delayed response, but I have not been on here lately. My wedding day is May 7th and I'm doing my own centerpieces and aisle decor. I'm going to pack as much as possible. My colors are shades of purple. I'm going for a more elegant but simple looks. My bridesmaids are wearing eggplant purple dresses, but I'm decorating with different shades of purple. I've purchased lavender, purple, and cream flowers with accents of green. They are silk flower which look pretty realistic. I also purchased lavender and silver sequin table runners and different votives and submersible lights that I may add some accents to. I'm trying to find mercury glass vases for the flowers (but might opt to DIY with plastic containers so they travel better). If you are serious about sharing any of the decor, I would be happy to make arrangements and leave when I can there. Just let me know!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks,<br>\nJamie<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Jamie,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry I have not been on here in a while either!\u00a0 I think I am going to stick with corals and oranges.\u00a0 My mother in law wants to help with the decorations.\u00a0 I did think of doing purples and teals for a little bit. Purple does sound beautiful!! Do you have any pictures you could send me of what you are thinking? Thanks so much!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Christine<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388150678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.43.251.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"999d92cb2c5ddf4e8518b8a8dd092626","RawContent":"@[member=\"Cwright\"] Thank you! That definitely helps to see it! I would love the wooden plank so I can walk down the middle the whole way but it&#039;s way too expensive!","Attachments":[],"Id":1879320,"PostDate":1417279968,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275744\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cwright<\/span><\/a> Thank you! That definitely helps to see it! I would love the wooden plank so I can walk down the middle the whole way but it's way too expensive!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccalightsey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.190.197.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405539863,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279045.jpg?_r=1434956018","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"RebeLight","Id":279045,"Name":"RebeLight","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":225,"TotalPages":23,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":220},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
