Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.179.232","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc7d3c56939cbba63fbbca1e091116aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you @&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/\" title=\"\"&gt;kosrae89&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and @[member=\"JYINGLI1\"] for your quick replies. My guests and I will be flying from Toronto, Canada, so I hope I can get prices similar to yours from here.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m so amazed at how helpful everyone is with answering questions. Thanks again!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882058,"PostDate":1420579230,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you @<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>kosrae89<\/a>\u00a0and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279519-jyingli1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JYINGLI1<\/span><\/a> for your quick replies. My guests and I will be flying from Toronto, Canada, so I hope I can get prices similar to yours from here.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm so amazed at how helpful everyone is with answering questions. Thanks again!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alicia.wm.yeh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.179.189","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420481209,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Alicia328","Id":281612,"Name":"Alicia328","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.43.251.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420590571,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0de286a379469611d5bc22cb473dd9e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Alicia328\"] Congratulations on your engagement!!! We basically told our agent what we were looking for, what our budget is and what we wanted to keep the price at for our guests and they gave is some suggested places and we decided from there. There are sooooo many reviews online and every resort looks nice in the pictures on their website, so it was tough deciding. Luckily one of my bridesmaids had just gone to Now Larimar and loved it so that made me more comfortable picking this resort! This site has been so helpful &amp;amp; everyone is so nice! Good luck with your planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882067,"PostDate":1420582092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281612\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281612-alicia328\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Alicia328<\/span><\/a> Congratulations on your engagement!!! We basically told our agent what we were looking for, what our budget is and what we wanted to keep the price at for our guests and they gave is some suggested places and we decided from there. There are sooooo many reviews online and every resort looks nice in the pictures on their website, so it was tough deciding. Luckily one of my bridesmaids had just gone to Now Larimar and loved it so that made me more comfortable picking this resort! This site has been so helpful & everyone is so nice! Good luck with your planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccalightsey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.190.197.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405539863,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279045.jpg?_r=1434956018","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"RebeLight","Id":279045,"Name":"RebeLight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420624436,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5eafda55c78cef9f80c825ad5da36579","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Alicia328\" post=\"1882058\" timestamp=\"1420593630\"]\nThank you @[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/\"]kosrae89[\/url] and @[member=\"JYINGLI1\"] for your quick replies. My guests and I will be flying from Toronto, Canada, so I hope I can get prices similar to yours from here.\n\nI&#039;m so amazed at how helpful everyone is with answering questions. Thanks again!! :)[\/quote]Congrats!!! The fact your are Canadian gives you better package options - ie our prices included airfare, resort,transfers and tax. I recommend finding a good travel agent who specializes in destination weddings to get you started. \n\nI ended  up with air Canada Vacations and with them we got a free package (minus taxes) for every 17th person booked and got a free upgrade to first class.   Also our group\nrate was always better than any price listed online :) \n\nOur guests from Toronto to the Mayan are paying $1465 which is all inclusive in price for 7 nights. \n\nGood luck. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1882093,"PostDate":1420624387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Alicia328, on 06 January 2015 - 09:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nThank you @<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>kosrae89<\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279519-jyingli1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JYINGLI1<\/span><\/a> for your quick replies. My guests and I will be flying from Toronto, Canada, so I hope I can get prices similar to yours from here.<br><br>\nI'm so amazed at how helpful everyone is with answering questions. Thanks again!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\nCongrats!!! The fact your are Canadian gives you better package options - ie our prices included airfare, resort,transfers and tax. I recommend finding a good travel agent who specializes in destination weddings to get you started. <br><br>\nI ended  up with air Canada Vacations and with them we got a free package (minus taxes) for every 17th person booked and got a free upgrade to first class.   Also our group<br>\nrate was always better than any price listed online <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br>\nOur guests from Toronto to the Mayan are paying $1465 which is all inclusive in price for 7 nights. <br><br>\nGood luck. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.190.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b19f8059f6f627839874d544e38f523c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1882093\" timestamp=\"1420638787\"]\nCongrats!!! The fact your are Canadian gives you better package options - ie our prices included airfare, resort,transfers and tax. I recommend finding a good travel agent who specializes in destination weddings to get you started.\n\nI ended up with air Canada Vacations and with them we got a free package (minus taxes) for every 17th person booked and got a free upgrade to first class. Also our group\nrate was always better than any price listed online :)\n\nOur guests from Toronto to the Mayan are paying $1465 which is all inclusive in price for 7 nights.\n\nGood luck.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\n[quote name=\"RebeLight\" post=\"1882067\" timestamp=\"1420596492\"]\n@[member=\"Alicia328\"] Congratulations on your engagement!!! We basically told our agent what we were looking for, what our budget is and what we wanted to keep the price at for our guests and they gave is some suggested places and we decided from there. There are sooooo many reviews online and every resort looks nice in the pictures on their website, so it was tough deciding. Luckily one of my bridesmaids had just gone to Now Larimar and loved it so that made me more comfortable picking this resort! This site has been so helpful &amp;amp; everyone is so nice! Good luck with your planning![\/quote]\n Thanks so much for your handy tips, ladies! I will reach out to a travel agent (which I haven&#039;t done yet). This site has been so so so helpful!!! Thank you!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1882272,"PostDate":1420744435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 07 January 2015 - 09:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congrats!!! The fact your are Canadian gives you better package options - ie our prices included airfare, resort,transfers and tax. I recommend finding a good travel agent who specializes in destination weddings to get you started.<br><br>\nI ended up with air Canada Vacations and with them we got a free package (minus taxes) for every 17th person booked and got a free upgrade to first class. Also our group<br>\nrate was always better than any price listed online <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nOur guests from Toronto to the Mayan are paying $1465 which is all inclusive in price for 7 nights.<br><br>\nGood luck.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RebeLight, on 06 January 2015 - 10:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281612\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281612-alicia328\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Alicia328<\/span><\/a> Congratulations on your engagement!!! We basically told our agent what we were looking for, what our budget is and what we wanted to keep the price at for our guests and they gave is some suggested places and we decided from there. There are sooooo many reviews online and every resort looks nice in the pictures on their website, so it was tough deciding. Luckily one of my bridesmaids had just gone to Now Larimar and loved it so that made me more comfortable picking this resort! This site has been so helpful & everyone is so nice! Good luck with your planning!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0Thanks so much for your handy tips, ladies! I will reach out to a travel agent (which I haven't done yet). This site has been so so so helpful!!! Thank you!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alicia.wm.yeh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.179.189","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420481209,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Alicia328","Id":281612,"Name":"Alicia328","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4d87be8b751e090a36a666d1f053d41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;kosrae89&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your pictures are stunning!! How long in advance did you give music choices to the DJ?&amp;nbsp; Also, what did your menus look like?&amp;nbsp; Were you happy with them?&amp;nbsp; Congratulations on your beautiful wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Christine&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882287,"PostDate":1420753337,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>kosrae89<\/span><\/a><\/span>!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your pictures are stunning!! How long in advance did you give music choices to the DJ?\u00a0 Also, what did your menus look like?\u00a0 Were you happy with them?\u00a0 Congratulations on your beautiful wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Christine<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388150678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.27.188.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f131a93041bcfdb8c52a058e2d16790","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Cwright\" post=\"1882287\" timestamp=\"1420767737\"]\nHi @[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/\"]kosrae89[\/url]!\n\nYour pictures are stunning!! How long in advance did you give music choices to the DJ?  Also, what did your menus look like?  Were you happy with them?  Congratulations on your beautiful wedding!\n\nChristine[\/quote]Thank you so much!!\n\nWe sent in our music choices for the DJ about 2 months before the wedding.\n\nFor the menus, we had a larger menu that we had printed framed and we put that on the guest book table for everyone to see when we walked in. We figured it saved a little money from printing a bunch of them and most people wouldn&#039;t care to take the menu home with them, so this way we had a keepsake to hang up and saved a little money. Although, the resort provided us with menus for everyone that we were not expecting. They weren&#039;t anything super fancy, but they were still nice and it was a nice touch for them to do. They were folded sheets of paper (slightly thicker than computer paper) with the menu items typed on them in English and Spanish. I am having trouble getting pictures to insert into the post, so I will just add them to the photo site with the wedding pictures so you can see what we had for our menu and what they gave us.","Attachments":[],"Id":1882314,"PostDate":1420758439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Cwright, on 08 January 2015 - 09:42 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi @<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>kosrae89<\/a>!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your pictures are stunning!! How long in advance did you give music choices to the DJ?\u00a0 Also, what did your menus look like?\u00a0 Were you happy with them?\u00a0 Congratulations on your beautiful wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Christine<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you so much!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We sent in our music choices for the DJ about 2 months before the wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the menus, we had a larger menu that we had printed framed and we put that on the guest book table for everyone to see when we walked in. We figured it saved a little money from printing a bunch of them and most people wouldn't care to take the menu home with them, so this way we had a keepsake to hang up and saved a little money. Although, the resort provided us with menus for everyone that we were not expecting. They weren't anything super fancy, but they were still nice and it was a nice touch for them to do. They were folded sheets of paper (slightly thicker than computer paper) with the menu items typed on them in English and Spanish. I am having trouble getting pictures to insert into the post, so I will just add them to the photo site with the wedding pictures so you can see what we had for our menu and what they gave us.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cneumann1289@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.68.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415455102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kosrae89","Id":281044,"Name":"kosrae89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.31.10.81","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fb86ebc7af0393ef1af68f6640205c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve just confirmed my contract for Now 8.22.2015.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am bummed that all that was available for the ceremony slot was 3:00pm. It seems too early for beach ceremony...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But, I am happy that I made my selection, have my site up and running for the guests to book, and now I can finally focus on the theme, and saving money!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;So I travel to the DR throughout the year and November Thanksgiving week is expensive but after labor day through 2\/3rd week of November is the winding down season... then it picks up for december holidays. Please note that because it is considered the low season, many resorts do their renovations, additions, construction and remodeling around this time. It is cyclical so, they do not do renovations every year, but just be mindful of this possibility.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Fall in the DR is beautiful. You should be able to get prices under $1500 if you do that hard leg work like Jamie said. Good luck.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882529,"PostDate":1420980600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've just confirmed my contract for Now 8.22.2015.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am bummed that all that was available for the ceremony slot was 3:00pm. It seems too early for beach ceremony...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But, I am happy that I made my selection, have my site up and running for the guests to book, and now I can finally focus on the theme, and saving money!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>So I travel to the DR throughout the year and November Thanksgiving week is expensive but after labor day through 2\/3rd week of November is the winding down season... then it picks up for december holidays. Please note that because it is considered the low season, many resorts do their renovations, additions, construction and remodeling around this time. It is cyclical so, they do not do renovations every year, but just be mindful of this possibility.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Fall in the DR is beautiful. You should be able to get prices under $1500 if you do that hard leg work like Jamie said. Good luck.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pbeltreesq@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.31.10.81","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419606862,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Montana","Id":281487,"Name":"Montana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"687ded02d40bed3bce45f300c1a556d3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kosrae89\" post=\"1882314\" timestamp=\"1420772839\"]\nThank you so much!!\n\nWe sent in our music choices for the DJ about 2 months before the wedding.\n\nFor the menus, we had a larger menu that we had printed framed and we put that on the guest book table for everyone to see when we walked in. We figured it saved a little money from printing a bunch of them and most people wouldn&#039;t care to take the menu home with them, so this way we had a keepsake to hang up and saved a little money. Although, the resort provided us with menus for everyone that we were not expecting. They weren&#039;t anything super fancy, but they were still nice and it was a nice touch for them to do. They were folded sheets of paper (slightly thicker than computer paper) with the menu items typed on them in English and Spanish. I am having trouble getting pictures to insert into the post, so I will just add them to the photo site with the wedding pictures so you can see what we had for our menu and what they gave us.[\/quote]\nThank you soo much for your response!  I love your idea to bring a framed menu- what a great keepsake too!  Good to know they have individual menus too! Thanks for adding the pictures!  I will take a look.  :)  I so appreciate all of your advice and responses.  I am nervous as I just want everyone to have a great time, and have gotten some push back about having a destination wedding.  You have made me feel more at ease. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1882551,"PostDate":1420992027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kosrae89, on 08 January 2015 - 11:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you so much!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We sent in our music choices for the DJ about 2 months before the wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the menus, we had a larger menu that we had printed framed and we put that on the guest book table for everyone to see when we walked in. We figured it saved a little money from printing a bunch of them and most people wouldn't care to take the menu home with them, so this way we had a keepsake to hang up and saved a little money. Although, the resort provided us with menus for everyone that we were not expecting. They weren't anything super fancy, but they were still nice and it was a nice touch for them to do. They were folded sheets of paper (slightly thicker than computer paper) with the menu items typed on them in English and Spanish. I am having trouble getting pictures to insert into the post, so I will just add them to the photo site with the wedding pictures so you can see what we had for our menu and what they gave us.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you soo much for your response!\u00a0 I love your idea to bring a framed menu- what a great keepsake too!\u00a0 Good to know they have individual menus too! Thanks for adding the pictures!\u00a0 I will take a look.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I so appreciate all of your advice and responses.\u00a0 I am nervous as I just want everyone to have a great time, and have gotten some push back about having a destination wedding.\u00a0 You have made me feel more at ease. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388150678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.55.192.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac3d0aa562960417d18bfac58883eb95","RawContent":"Hey girls!\n\n\nAnyone have any thoughts on wedding ceremony readings for a non-religious, symbolic ceremony?  Or, does anyone know what the officiant will be saying?\n\n\nThanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1882576,"PostDate":1421006674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey girls!<br><br>\nAnyone have any thoughts on wedding ceremony readings for a non-religious, symbolic ceremony?  Or, does anyone know what the officiant will be saying?<br><br>\nThanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danamarielouise@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.89.226.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393261367,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Danamarielouise","Id":276863,"Name":"Danamarielouise","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.27.188.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6111c7c359a6a6cc26b8df3a9d260de3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Cwright\" post=\"1882551\" timestamp=\"1421006427\"]\nThank you soo much for your response!  I love your idea to bring a framed menu- what a great keepsake too!  Good to know they have individual menus too! Thanks for adding the pictures!  I will take a look.  :)  I so appreciate all of your advice and responses.  I am nervous as I just want everyone to have a great time, and have gotten some push back about having a destination wedding.  You have made me feel more at ease. :)[\/quote]I am glad my responses have been helpful! I was definitely nervous before our trip too and I just wanted everyone to have a great time. And it really worked out great. We had so many different ages and personalities in our group, but everyone really had a wonderful time. We were able to do things as a group many nights, but everyone was also able to do their own things and everyone had an amazing time! I felt nervous about it until we got to the resort, but once we were all there, it was great! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1882700,"PostDate":1421104325,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Cwright, on 11 January 2015 - 04:00 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you soo much for your response!\u00a0 I love your idea to bring a framed menu- what a great keepsake too!\u00a0 Good to know they have individual menus too! Thanks for adding the pictures!\u00a0 I will take a look.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I so appreciate all of your advice and responses.\u00a0 I am nervous as I just want everyone to have a great time, and have gotten some push back about having a destination wedding.\u00a0 You have made me feel more at ease. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I am glad my responses have been helpful! I was definitely nervous before our trip too and I just wanted everyone to have a great time. And it really worked out great. We had so many different ages and personalities in our group, but everyone really had a wonderful time. We were able to do things as a group many nights, but everyone was also able to do their own things and everyone had an amazing time! I felt nervous about it until we got to the resort, but once we were all there, it was great! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cneumann1289@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.68.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415455102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kosrae89","Id":281044,"Name":"kosrae89","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":225,"TotalPages":23,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":110,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":220},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
