{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.27.188.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a648b200e5aac9a23a20e1df7ba2c77c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Cwright\" post=\"1882551\" timestamp=\"1421006427\"]\nThank you soo much for your response!  I love your idea to bring a framed menu- what a great keepsake too!  Good to know they have individual menus too! Thanks for adding the pictures!  I will take a look.  :)  I so appreciate all of your advice and responses.  I am nervous as I just want everyone to have a great time, and have gotten some push back about having a destination wedding.  You have made me feel more at ease. :)[\/quote]I am glad my responses have been helpful! I was definitely nervous before our trip too and I just wanted everyone to have a great time. And it really worked out great. We had so many different ages and personalities in our group, but everyone really had a wonderful time. We were able to do things as a group many nights, but everyone was also able to do their own things and everyone had an amazing time! I felt nervous about it until we got to the resort, but once we were all there, it was great! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1882704,"PostDate":1421106676,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Cwright, on 11 January 2015 - 04:00 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you soo much for your response!\u00a0 I love your idea to bring a framed menu- what a great keepsake too!\u00a0 Good to know they have individual menus too! Thanks for adding the pictures!\u00a0 I will take a look.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I so appreciate all of your advice and responses.\u00a0 I am nervous as I just want everyone to have a great time, and have gotten some push back about having a destination wedding.\u00a0 You have made me feel more at ease. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I am glad my responses have been helpful! I was definitely nervous before our trip too and I just wanted everyone to have a great time. And it really worked out great. We had so many different ages and personalities in our group, but everyone really had a wonderful time. We were able to do things as a group many nights, but everyone was also able to do their own things and everyone had an amazing time! I felt nervous about it until we got to the resort, but once we were all there, it was great! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cneumann1289@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.68.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415455102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kosrae89","Id":281044,"Name":"kosrae89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.43.251.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef24bedda1479068aa5dd28fe2a069e6","RawContent":"@[member=\"Danamarielouise\"] Are you hiring an outside officiant? If you&#039;re using what comes with your package, I believe the wedding coordinator is the one that performs the ceremony. They sent me the script and I decided to hire Pastor Rick York. His fee is very reasonable.  I&#039;d be happy to send you the ceremony he sent me if you&#039;d like! Or, you can reach out to him &amp;amp; see if he&#039;s available on your date &amp;amp; he&#039;ll send you a few options to choose from. Search his name on this site and all you find is amazing reviews. All the little extras add up but I felt like this was worth it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1882782,"PostDate":1421183718,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276863\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276863-danamarielouise\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danamarielouise<\/span><\/a> Are you hiring an outside officiant? If you're using what comes with your package, I believe the wedding coordinator is the one that performs the ceremony. They sent me the script and I decided to hire Pastor Rick York. His fee is very reasonable.  I'd be happy to send you the ceremony he sent me if you'd like! Or, you can reach out to him & see if he's available on your date & he'll send you a few options to choose from. Search his name on this site and all you find is amazing reviews. All the little extras add up but I felt like this was worth it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccalightsey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.190.197.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405539863,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279045.jpg?_r=1434956018","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"RebeLight","Id":279045,"Name":"RebeLight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.55.192.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7fa881000bb732798c16e5578d9b4780","RawContent":"@[member=\"RebeLight\"] we were just having the included officiant!  I didn&#039;t realize I could ask her for the script, will request it and see - thanks for the tip!","Attachments":[],"Id":1882868,"PostDate":1421243733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279045\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279045-rebelight\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RebeLight<\/span><\/a> we were just having the included officiant!  I didn't realize I could ask her for the script, will request it and see - thanks for the tip!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danamarielouise@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.89.226.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393261367,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Danamarielouise","Id":276863,"Name":"Danamarielouise","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"157.142.25.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef062d3511eda26db60bc2608f186c47","RawContent":"@[member=\"kosrae89\"] thanks for sharing all about your wedding day! I am getting married at now in November and am considering doing welcome bags.  What did you include in yours?  Or if anyone else has welcome bag ideas\/pics please let me know...","Attachments":[],"Id":1882971,"PostDate":1421300131,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281044\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kosrae89<\/span><\/a> thanks for sharing all about your wedding day! I am getting married at now in November and am considering doing welcome bags.  What did you include in yours?  Or if anyone else has welcome bag ideas\/pics please let me know...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"swiens1@uco.edu","IpAddress":"157.142.25.168","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421299345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sjw015","Id":281734,"Name":"sjw015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.206.77.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a409fb9f2e129d7fc1dd1e1b6d36767","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi, I am trying to get more information for this resort... I&#039;m probably going to have about 160 people attend so I&#039;m a little nervous about pricing. Does anyone know if the open bar is included in the packages and\/or the buffet menu cost?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883029,"PostDate":1421342871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi, I am trying to get more information for this resort... I'm probably going to have about 160 people attend so I'm a little nervous about pricing. Does anyone know if the open bar is included in the packages and\/or the buffet menu cost?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tatiana.morales@sbschools.org","IpAddress":"50.206.77.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421342738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tbg0819","Id":281739,"Name":"tbg0819","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.222.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c54587bba1247569c4366dfe2357b05d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danamarielouise\"] I got confirmation from the spa that they will not take appointments until 2-3 months before. For me that is unfair. There are two other weddings that day... What if I get stuck with a crappy slot, ie way too early??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Not too happy about not knowing whether I will get time slots I want for spa and salon.. but I am not going to worry about it now... I will focus on.. the dress... been dress shopping this weekend... omg... why did i wait so long.. i feel the pressure is on bigtime.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tbg0819\"] The highest package, the Divine package is for 25- beyond that there is a per person fee for everything. liquor as well during the cocktail hour, toast, and I do not recall about the reception. As I started to do the math, I was apprehensive about having sent out 100 Save the Dates. I am hoping I max out at 50-60.... we&#039;ll see.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883281,"PostDate":1421615218,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276863\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276863-danamarielouise\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danamarielouise<\/span><\/a> I got confirmation from the spa that they will not take appointments until 2-3 months before. For me that is unfair. There are two other weddings that day... What if I get stuck with a crappy slot, ie way too early??<\/p>\n<p>Not too happy about not knowing whether I will get time slots I want for spa and salon.. but I am not going to worry about it now... I will focus on.. the dress... been dress shopping this weekend... omg... why did i wait so long.. i feel the pressure is on bigtime.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281739\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281739-tbg0819\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tbg0819<\/span><\/a> The highest package, the Divine package is for 25- beyond that there is a per person fee for everything. liquor as well during the cocktail hour, toast, and I do not recall about the reception. As I started to do the math, I was apprehensive about having sent out 100 Save the Dates. I am hoping I max out at 50-60.... we'll see.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pbeltreesq@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.31.10.81","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419606862,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Montana","Id":281487,"Name":"Montana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.105.47.64","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"226e7cae0e662c9df5edd39ef087ac4f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Montana\"] - Thank you very much for the information. The wedding coordinator confirmed that the extra charge per guest for the buffet prices do include open bar for the reception. Thankfully! I hear ya on sending out a lot of invites. We initially wanted a destination wedding thinking that we would get a small group (we have HUGE families - our guest list is 425 people...) so far&amp;nbsp;we&#039;re estimating that 160 will make it to the wedding! but even that is a little optimistic I think...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883371,"PostDate":1421691824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281487\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281487-montana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Montana<\/span><\/a> - Thank you very much for the information. The wedding coordinator confirmed that the extra charge per guest for the buffet prices do include open bar for the reception. Thankfully! I hear ya on sending out a lot of invites. We initially wanted a destination wedding thinking that we would get a small group (we have HUGE families - our guest list is 425 people...) so far\u00a0we're estimating that 160 will make it to the wedding! but even that is a little optimistic I think...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tatiana.morales@sbschools.org","IpAddress":"50.206.77.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421342738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tbg0819","Id":281739,"Name":"tbg0819","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.69.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba802da60f6f6eb7f0e88682184b93fa","RawContent":"Hi everyone\n\nMy wedding is May 2015.\nDoes anyone know how the DJ and MC are at the resort?\n\nThanks\n\nAnd I heard about the photographer and that they are ok. Any one seen or heard otherwise, making me nervous","Attachments":[],"Id":1883535,"PostDate":1421779295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone\n\nMy wedding is May 2015.\nDoes anyone know how the DJ and MC are at the resort?\n\nThanks\n\nAnd I heard about the photographer and that they are ok. Any one seen or heard otherwise, making me nervous\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"astawarz@live.ca","IpAddress":"142.46.224.163","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415506605,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"astawarz","Id":281052,"Name":"astawarz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.43.251.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66a63ec476ac23cb051636ef21509639","RawContent":"Hi everyone! Does anyone know about tipping? I read that you should tip the wedding coordinator, DJ, etc., but I have no idea how much. Any thoughts??","Attachments":[],"Id":1883556,"PostDate":1421789546,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! Does anyone know about tipping? I read that you should tip the wedding coordinator, DJ, etc., but I have no idea how much. Any thoughts??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccalightsey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.190.197.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405539863,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279045.jpg?_r=1434956018","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"RebeLight","Id":279045,"Name":"RebeLight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.162.168.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5139046a801066327fe9bbeaac225939","RawContent":"[quote name=\"sjw015\" post=\"1882971\" timestamp=\"1421314531\"]\n@[member=\"kosrae89\"] thanks for sharing all about your wedding day! I am getting married at now in November and am considering doing welcome bags.  What did you include in yours?  Or if anyone else has welcome bag ideas\/pics please let me know...[\/quote]\nHi! I am having my wedding Aug. 8 and considering welcome beach totes. Some things I plan to include are a Bubba so guests can keep their drinks cold,  pain killers,  sunscreen, alka seltzer. Want to add more but not sure yet. Any suggestions are welcome :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1883558,"PostDate":1421790469,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>sjw015, on 15 January 2015 - 05:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281044\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281044-kosrae89\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kosrae89<\/span><\/a> thanks for sharing all about your wedding day! I am getting married at now in November and am considering doing welcome bags.  What did you include in yours?  Or if anyone else has welcome bag ideas\/pics please let me know...<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi! I am having my wedding Aug. 8 and considering welcome beach totes. Some things I plan to include are a Bubba so guests can keep their drinks cold,  pain killers,  sunscreen, alka seltzer. Want to add more but not sure yet. Any suggestions are welcome <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ariadna.diaz89@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"104.162.168.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413583874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jariana2010","Id":280700,"Name":"Jariana2010","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":225,"TotalPages":23,"CurrentPage":110,"NextPage":120,"PreviousPage":100,"LastPage":220},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
