{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.35.109.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1dabfa9c4174fa478b7cdc84db138387","RawContent":"I flew southwest and had no issues there isn&#039;t a closet however if you have an empty flight (ours was 22 ppl for 180 capacity) you&#039;ll have an overhead for just your dress!!!\n\n[quote name=\"Cwright\" post=\"1893591\" timestamp=\"1429424319\"]\nHey guys!\n \nAny experiences about carrying your dress on the plane?  I am getting nervous about this![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1896474,"PostDate":1431818892,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I flew southwest and had no issues there isn't a closet however if you have an empty flight (ours was 22 ppl for 180 capacity) you'll have an overhead for just your dress!!!<br><br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Cwright, on 19 April 2015 - 02:18 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hey guys!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nAny experiences about carrying your dress on the plane?\u00a0 I am getting nervous about this!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.33.57.155","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7be03b6d7e3617599ac2c46ec12491c1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rmg428\" post=\"1896429\" timestamp=\"1431727991\"]\nI&#039;m at the fountain and the quiet pool. What time is your ceremony? \nI haven&#039;t had many issues with communication. I&#039;ve been working wirh my WC since July of last year. Is there anything I can help answer? I feel like I could work there with everything I&#039;ve learned the past year :-)[\/quote]Our ceremony is at 4 pm. \n\nWhat are you doing as far as centerpieces. And Dj?  We haven&#039;t made up our minds. We booked around the same time. July maybe August.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896548,"PostDate":1431970606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rmg428, on 15 May 2015 - 06:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm at the fountain and the quiet pool. What time is your ceremony? <br>\nI haven't had many issues with communication. I've been working wirh my WC since July of last year. Is there anything I can help answer? I feel like I could work there with everything I've learned the past year :-)<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nOur ceremony is at 4 pm. <br><br>\nWhat are you doing as far as centerpieces. And Dj?  We haven't made up our minds. We booked around the same time. July maybe August. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"coachyearwood@aol.com","IpAddress":"66.87.116.161","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431683162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283110.jpg?_r=1431697796","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"YearKerr09","Id":283110,"Name":"YearKerr09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.201.36.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b18439ff3c0950b48812c875e086a57c","RawContent":"We are at 5pm at the fountain, so right after you! I&#039;m doing square paper lanterns, votives, and sea glass for the table decor. I am using the hotel DJ, but I hear a lot of good things about DJ mania as well. I&#039;m also bringing in my own officiant for the wedding... I don&#039;t know how I feel about the wedding coordinator doing it. I&#039;m rally excited about staying at NOW! I&#039;ve heard so many good things!","Attachments":[],"Id":1896563,"PostDate":1431986640,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are at 5pm at the fountain, so right after you! I'm doing square paper lanterns, votives, and sea glass for the table decor. I am using the hotel DJ, but I hear a lot of good things about DJ mania as well. I'm also bringing in my own officiant for the wedding... I don't know how I feel about the wedding coordinator doing it. I'm rally excited about staying at NOW! I've heard so many good things! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ritagardner@earthlink.net","IpAddress":"199.173.225.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407422015,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279351.jpg?_r=1422475580","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rmg428","Id":279351,"Name":"rmg428","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.8.84.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a8701ea3047836265e95cf067f6dcc7","RawContent":"I am getting married at Now in Aug 2015 and my wedding cordinator seems really slow in responding has anyone had issues with responses?","Attachments":[],"Id":1897390,"PostDate":1432768233,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married at Now in Aug 2015 and my wedding cordinator seems really slow in responding has anyone had issues with responses?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dibo930@aol.com","IpAddress":"50.8.84.124","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432767962,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283278.jpg?_r=1439751768","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Dina821","Id":283278,"Name":"Dina821","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.35.109.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b94b419e6ecac6931944cdf107fe3bf","RawContent":"@[member=\"Dina821\"] yes, they are very much on island time and are extremely slow at responding... That drove me crazy the entire two years of planning; however once you arrive at the resort you are catered too!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897466,"PostDate":1432852514,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283278\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283278-dina821\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Dina821<\/span><\/a> yes, they are very much on island time and are extremely slow at responding... That drove me crazy the entire two years of planning; however once you arrive at the resort you are catered too!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.8.84.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2964067c5209d406f76665a19fd10261","RawContent":"@[member=\"DR2015\"] thank you for responding! I see you just got married, did you do a civil or symbolic ceremony? What location did you choose? I have chosen the beach and I am second guessing my decision.","Attachments":[],"Id":1897472,"PostDate":1432854311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272393\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272393-dr2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DR2015<\/span><\/a> thank you for responding! I see you just got married, did you do a civil or symbolic ceremony? What location did you choose? I have chosen the beach and I am second guessing my decision. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dibo930@aol.com","IpAddress":"50.8.84.124","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432767962,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283278.jpg?_r=1439751768","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Dina821","Id":283278,"Name":"Dina821","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.35.109.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a906677d05a3f5d2884e0de4ce423df0","RawContent":"@[member=\"Dina821\"] we chose the symbolic ceremony and did the legal \"stuff\" at home before we left. We had our ceremony\/cocktail hour on the beach at 4-5:45 and reception in the ball room at 6-10... \n\n\nWe had already visited the resort two years earlier (along with a few others) which made me decide on the beach location. \n\n\nWhy are you 2nd guessing? I can try to provide you with some info!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897544,"PostDate":1432934428,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283278\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283278-dina821\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Dina821<\/span><\/a> we chose the symbolic ceremony and did the legal \"stuff\" at home before we left. We had our ceremony\/cocktail hour on the beach at 4-5:45 and reception in the ball room at 6-10... <br><br>\nWe had already visited the resort two years earlier (along with a few others) which made me decide on the beach location. <br><br>\nWhy are you 2nd guessing? I can try to provide you with some info!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.8.84.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff495c18760415a3bc96bb9c9e365c8b","RawContent":"@[member=\"DR2015\"] there were some post of brides having their ceremony on the beach and they made statements about onlookers and lacking privacy. So I was second guessing it. We are having the ceremony at 4 and the cocktail hour at 4:30 and then the reception at 7 since we chose the pool location for the ceremony. may I ask what photographer did you use?","Attachments":[],"Id":1897556,"PostDate":1432945228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272393\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272393-dr2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DR2015<\/span><\/a> there were some post of brides having their ceremony on the beach and they made statements about onlookers and lacking privacy. So I was second guessing it. We are having the ceremony at 4 and the cocktail hour at 4:30 and then the reception at 7 since we chose the pool location for the ceremony. may I ask what photographer did you use? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dibo930@aol.com","IpAddress":"50.8.84.124","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432767962,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283278.jpg?_r=1439751768","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Dina821","Id":283278,"Name":"Dina821","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.35.109.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36bdc551ef79abe3a9140e57922acd04","RawContent":"@[member=\"Dina821\"] I would agree with lack of privacy but to be honest we had 75 guest so the additional 8-10 that were sitting on the beach didn&#039;t bother me personally... They weren&#039;t rude or any thing; they complimented and congratulated us and stood to clap after the ceremony.\n\n\nWe flew our photographer in with us; we did get the free pics from the resort that come with the package- I was not impressed with the prints or the lady who works there she was extremely rude.","Attachments":[],"Id":1897564,"PostDate":1432977727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283278\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283278-dina821\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Dina821<\/span><\/a> I would agree with lack of privacy but to be honest we had 75 guest so the additional 8-10 that were sitting on the beach didn't bother me personally... They weren't rude or any thing; they complimented and congratulated us and stood to clap after the ceremony.<br><br>\nWe flew our photographer in with us; we did get the free pics from the resort that come with the package- I was not impressed with the prints or the lady who works there she was extremely rude.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.8.84.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"416e9fe3ba56180d8f3270cc9a903f3a","RawContent":"@[member=\"DR2015\"] thank you for all the great info!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897590,"PostDate":1433018047,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272393\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272393-dr2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DR2015<\/span><\/a> thank you for all the great info!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dibo930@aol.com","IpAddress":"50.8.84.124","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432767962,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283278.jpg?_r=1439751768","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Dina821","Id":283278,"Name":"Dina821","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":225,"TotalPages":23,"CurrentPage":170,"NextPage":180,"PreviousPage":160,"LastPage":220},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
