Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.74.220.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ec62a2b4aee6f642e0aea40cbe97780","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies, I am getting married on the beach at the Now Larimar in January 2017 and am just wondering if someone could tell me if you walk down the \"aisle\" to a song?? At all the pictures I&#039;ve looked at I cant imagine where there would be speakers!! Please help :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909518,"PostDate":1452796650,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies, I am getting married on the beach at the Now Larimar in January 2017 and am just wondering if someone could tell me if you walk down the \"aisle\" to a song?? At all the pictures I've looked at I cant imagine where there would be speakers!! Please help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stacey.beaupre@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.74.220.95","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452796411,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"StaceyB24","Id":285903,"Name":"StaceyB24","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.226.209.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efeb996d1fdb72b16acaa9288a9ce2d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello 2015 Brides! My wedding is next weekend and I am trying to estimate $$ for tips. &amp;nbsp;We are having our reception poolside. How many bartenders and servers did you have? &amp;nbsp;THANK YOU!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912412,"PostDate":1459535155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello 2015 Brides! My wedding is next weekend and I am trying to estimate $$ for tips. \u00a0We are having our reception poolside. How many bartenders and servers did you have? \u00a0THANK YOU!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426931385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1460756999","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.162.136.86","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f47c75d4f56dc56ecaa48ceb258416df","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AshleyNYC323\" post=\"1912412\" timestamp=\"1459549555\"]\nHello 2015 Brides! My wedding is next weekend and I am trying to estimate $$ for tips.  We are having our reception poolside. How many bartenders and servers did you have?  THANK YOU![\/quote]How long are you staying?\n\nBetween wedding and any additional days?","Attachments":[],"Id":1912413,"PostDate":1459536188,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AshleyNYC323, on 01 April 2016 - 06:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hello 2015 Brides! My wedding is next weekend and I am trying to estimate $$ for tips.  We are having our reception poolside. How many bartenders and servers did you have?  THANK YOU!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHow long are you staying?<br><br>\nBetween wedding and any additional days?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ariadna.diaz89@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"104.162.168.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413583874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jariana2010","Id":280700,"Name":"Jariana2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.226.209.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1459537521,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfb9f33ea18870f2f73fbf7d32654aed","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Jariana2010\" post=\"1912413\" timestamp=\"1459550588\"]\nHow long are you staying?\n\nBetween wedding and any additional days?[\/quote]I am asking about the reception - not the trip.  Thank you, I should have been more clear. I tried to go back and edit my post but it won&#039;t let me now!\n \nThis ask is just for the private reception. I know how much we will be tipping the rest of the week.  Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1912414,"PostDate":1459537407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Jariana2010, on 01 April 2016 - 06:43 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>How long are you staying?<br><br>\nBetween wedding and any additional days?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I am asking about the reception - not the trip. \u00a0Thank you, I should have been more clear. I tried to go back and edit my post but it won't let me now!<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This ask is just for the private reception. I know how much we will be tipping the rest of the week. \u00a0Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426931385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1460756999","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.214.99.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca4f036e87fe4fb374162e38ddaba10f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AshleyNYC323\" post=\"1912414\" timestamp=\"1459551807\"]\nI am asking about the reception - not the trip.  Thank you, I should have been more clear. I tried to go back and edit my post but it won&#039;t let me now!\n\nThis ask is just for the private reception. I know how much we will be tipping the rest of the week.  Thanks![\/quote]For me it was a little different because I tipped before during and after wedding to various different people. \n\nSpecifically tips related to wedding and reception we probably tipped $75-100. This was mainly because we didn&#039;t pay for premium alcohol but I was able to convince the guy who setup the bar to put 3 bottles of Johnnie Walker black label without paying the fee for premium liquor for cocktail hour and for reception. \n\nAt the reception, We had 1 guy behind the bar and I want to say maybe 5 waiters. I know at the end of everything I dropped like $30 in their tip jar in which they all share. This $30 was part of the original $75-100 mentioned above. \n\nHope this helps.","Attachments":[],"Id":1912417,"PostDate":1459576238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AshleyNYC323, on 01 April 2016 - 07:03 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I am asking about the reception - not the trip.  Thank you, I should have been more clear. I tried to go back and edit my post but it won't let me now!<br><br>\nThis ask is just for the private reception. I know how much we will be tipping the rest of the week.  Thanks!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nFor me it was a little different because I tipped before during and after wedding to various different people. <br><br>\nSpecifically tips related to wedding and reception we probably tipped $75-100. This was mainly because we didn't pay for premium alcohol but I was able to convince the guy who setup the bar to put 3 bottles of Johnnie Walker black label without paying the fee for premium liquor for cocktail hour and for reception. <br><br>\nAt the reception, We had 1 guy behind the bar and I want to say maybe 5 waiters. I know at the end of everything I dropped like $30 in their tip jar in which they all share. This $30 was part of the original $75-100 mentioned above. <br><br>\nHope this helps. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ariadna.diaz89@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"104.162.168.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413583874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jariana2010","Id":280700,"Name":"Jariana2010","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":225,"TotalPages":23,"CurrentPage":220,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":210,"LastPage":220},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
