{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79717,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1446916035,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc6d1a4a2f62c485418ddda2f841c599","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wally 66\" Garment Bag.\t If you search online for this bag you will find it between $125-$140.&amp;nbsp; I am only asking $75 plus shipping for the bag.\u200b&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This bag has only been used once and is in excellent condition. My dress arrived in Mexico without a wrinkle and I didn&#039;t even have my dress steamed before the wedding because it stayed perfectly in this bag.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- The manufacture states the bag can hold up to 6 garments.&amp;nbsp; I took 2 wedding dresses (my actual dress and I had another for TTD), plus my daughter&#039;s bridesmaid dress and my rehearsal dress. It has padded roll bars to secure clothing and prevent wrinkles.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- It also has multiple pockets to hold \u200bshoes, jewelry and other accessories.&amp;nbsp; There is a large split&amp;nbsp;pocket in the front 17x22\"&amp;nbsp;and one single pocket&amp;nbsp;equal size on inside fold. There is two other 11x14\" pockets inside and also a smaller accessory pocket.   I was able to put&amp;nbsp;2 pairs of shoes, bride flops,&amp;nbsp;my jewelry, veil, bride robe, bride tank\/shorts plus dresses all in the bag.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;** note the only thing the bag does not have is the over the shoulder strap.&amp;nbsp; With everything I had in it, wasn&#039;t that heavy and fit perfectly in the overhead bid.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u200b&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Other Items&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\"I do \" - Victoria Secret line Bride tank, &amp;nbsp; size small   white\t  &amp;nbsp;$15&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gillian &amp;amp; O&#039;Malley&amp;nbsp; white Bride robe,&amp;nbsp; size  XS\/ extra&amp;nbsp;small\t $12&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If interested please let me know I it would ship from Fort Worth, TX&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":34261,"Name":"60 wally bag.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-274657-0-46484500-1446929929.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-274657-0-46484500-1446929929_thumb.png","Width":238,"Height":212},{"Id":34262,"Name":"VS bride tank.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-274657-0-35030300-1446930207.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-274657-0-35030300-1446930207_thumb.png","Width":225,"Height":225},{"Id":34263,"Name":"bride robe1.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-274657-0-16016500-1446930219.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-274657-0-16016500-1446930219_thumb.png","Width":194,"Height":259}],"Id":1907237,"PostDate":1446915591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wally 66\" Garment Bag.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 If you search online for this bag you will find it between $125-$140.\u00a0 I am only asking $75 plus shipping for the bag.\u200b<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This bag has only been used once and is in excellent condition. My dress arrived in Mexico without a wrinkle and I didn't even have my dress steamed before the wedding because it stayed perfectly in this bag.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- The manufacture states the bag can hold up to 6 garments.\u00a0 I took 2 wedding dresses (my actual dress and I had another for TTD), plus my daughter's bridesmaid dress and my rehearsal dress. It has padded roll bars to secure clothing and prevent wrinkles.<\/p>\n<p>- It also has multiple pockets to hold \u200bshoes, jewelry and other accessories.\u00a0 There is a large split\u00a0pocket in the front 17x22\"\u00a0and one single pocket\u00a0equal size on inside fold. There is two other 11x14\" pockets inside and also a smaller accessory pocket.\u00a0\u00a0 I was able to put\u00a02 pairs of shoes, bride flops,\u00a0my jewelry, veil, bride robe, bride tank\/shorts plus dresses all in the bag.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>** note the only thing the bag does not have is the over the shoulder strap.\u00a0 With everything I had in it, wasn't that heavy and fit perfectly in the overhead bid.<\/p>\n<p>\u200b<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Other Items<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\"I do \" - Victoria Secret line Bride tank, \u00a0 size small\u00a0\u00a0 white\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0$15<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gillian & O'Malley\u00a0 white Bride robe,\u00a0 size\u00a0\u00a0XS\/ extra\u00a0small\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 $12<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If interested please let me know I it would ship from Fort Worth, TX<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383038867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.85.228.77","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79717,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0d73fed5083392fa012883e5bc1093b","RawContent":"@[member=\"misbosox\"]\n\nIs your Wally bag still available?","Attachments":[],"Id":1911245,"PostDate":1456277654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274657\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274657-misbosox\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">misbosox<\/span><\/a><br>\nIs your Wally bag still available?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413941646,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
