{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78810,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b3000f0f68eca14719d9834c7bbc51f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veryvalero\" post=\"1886820\" timestamp=\"1424367484\"]\nAnd yet another reason why I love this forum.  I never even thought about a Wallybag.  All these little hidden expenses.  *sigh*\n\nMaybe I&#039;m just na\u00efve but I thought the dress would come with it&#039;s proper bag, but I guess not?[\/quote]I honestly didn&#039;t consider it until I spoke to a few other brides. It isn&#039;t a huge necessity, but I do love the idea of having the wally bag because it is more compact (folds and has a shoulder strap) and you can also put multiple garments in. I&#039;m going to have two dresses for the wedding and my FI&#039;s suit, so it will be really helpful.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886842,"PostDate":1424362968,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalero, on 19 February 2015 - 01:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>And yet another reason why I love this forum.\u00a0 I never even thought about a Wallybag.\u00a0 All these little hidden expenses.\u00a0 *sigh*<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maybe I'm just na\u00efve but I thought the dress would come with it's proper bag, but I guess not?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I honestly didn't consider it until I spoke to a few other brides. It isn't a huge necessity, but I do love the idea of having the wally bag because it is more compact (folds and has a shoulder strap) and you can also put multiple garments in. I'm going to have two dresses for the wedding and my FI's suit, so it will be really helpful.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78810,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66fe5da53aab6624ca86a99bee068ead","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1886772\" timestamp=\"1424311696\"]\n@[member=\"tygrrlily\"] Luckily I found someone selling their 66\" bag today for $75. I couldn&#039;t resist that price. She lives in Calgary, but says she is probably coming to Toronto in the spring and can meet up with me.[\/quote]If you plan on selling your wally bag after your wedding, please let me know. I do am looking for one. I live in the GTA.","Attachments":[],"Id":1890091,"PostDate":1426782431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 18 February 2015 - 10:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a> Luckily I found someone selling their 66\" bag today for $75. I couldn't resist that price. She lives in Calgary, but says she is probably coming to Toronto in the spring and can meet up with me.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>If you plan on selling your wally bag after your wedding, please let me know. I do am looking for one. I live in the GTA.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426158386,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47